  (text "Place every component on this sheet on the detachable PCB section.\nOnly +3V3, GND, SDA, SCL and INT_N may cross the break line.\nKeep connector pads/components clear of tabs, score and fracture area.\nJ4 (main board) <-> J5 (module): straight-through five-wire reconnect.\nJ3 is the requested 9-pin keyboard header and is DNP / user fitted."
    (at 20.32 157.48 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid 38ac153b-5ff6-5ebe-a014-08c99eca29a5)
  )
  (text "100 kHz maximum. A2:A0 = 000, address 0x20 (PCF8574T).\nJ3: pins 1 / 9 NC; pins 2..8 = P0..P6. U8 P7 unused.\nCenter seven preserve old board J2.1..7 -> P0..P6 order.\nCommon 9-position keypad: rows P1/P6/P5/P3; columns P2/P0/P4.\nWrite 1 to release inputs; scan one column low, debounce in firmware.\nR38/R39 stay DNP on shared bus; see docs/keyboard-interface.md."
    (at 20.32 189.23 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.15 1.15)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid 6beba78b-7d58-5251-8d19-da0e1b3c3d34)
  )
